{"unit_id":"dawsondx__dsh-web-open#feature-1","repo":"dawsondx/dsh-web-open","commit":"89cf7af04ff8448de5dfd8b2fc362b798e70b6a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-open 的功能「就绪后打开浏览器」：DSH Web 就绪后自动打开浏览器：插件等待启动服务可用，再调用当前平台的默认浏览器启动器。 触发时机为 DSH Web 启动并完成服务绑定。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:35-45"]}
