{"unit_id":"dawsondx__dsh-web-open#feature-3","repo":"dawsondx/dsh-web-open","commit":"89cf7af04ff8448de5dfd8b2fc362b798e70b6a7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-open 的功能「跨平台启动器回退」：按操作系统选择浏览器启动方式：macOS 使用 open，Windows 使用 cmd.exe，Linux 查找常见浏览器命令。 触发时机为 DSH Web 启动并完成服务绑定。","source":"generated","evidence":["opener.js:11-20","opener.js:109-116"]}
